# {{ title }}

## When to use

Use this skill when the user asks to work on {{ name }}.

## Instructions

1. Follow `docs/architecture.md` — Domain → Application → Infrastructure → Presentation.
2. Put business capabilities in `apps/api/app/Modules/{Name}`, never a flat Controllers/Services tree.
3. Portals talk only to the API gateway (`apps/api`). Never call microservice URLs from the browser.
4. Generate code with Artisan (`make:module`, `make:action`, `make:dto`) rather than inventing structure.

## Checklist

- [ ] Module provider registered in `bootstrap/providers.php`
- [ ] Controllers call Actions only
- [ ] Repository contracts live in Domain; implementations in Infrastructure
- [ ] Cross-module access uses contracts or events
